# TYPOGRAPHY (TYPO-001)

Canon: [`docs/UI_TOKENS.md`](../docs/UI_TOKENS.md#typography-tokens), [`docs/TYPOGRAPHY_UNIFICATION.md`](../docs/TYPOGRAPHY_UNIFICATION.md).

## Semantic roles

| Role | Use for | Class / helper |
|------|---------|----------------|
| **heading** | Screen titles, modal titles | `typographyClass.heading`, `ScreenTitle` |
| **body** | Paragraphs, toast, modal copy | `typographyClass.body` |
| **body-input** | `<input>`, `<textarea>` (TMA ≥16px) | `typographyClass.bodyInput` |
| **label** | Uppercase micro-labels, Button text | `typographyClass.label`, `formLabelClass`, `labelSectionClass` |
| **caption** | Brand tagline, version, muted micro copy | `typographyClass.caption`, `brandCaptionClass`, `captionMutedClass` |
| **system** | Banners, status, compact meta | `typographyClass.system`, `systemBannerClass`, `systemStatusClass` |
| **game-title** | Logo only | `text-7xl` — **frozen**, no token |

Import map: `packages/client/src/constants/typography.ts`.

## Заборонено в app UI

- Нові `text-[Npx]` у `packages/client/src` (окрім whitelist нижче).
- Нові `text-sm` / `text-xs` для **semantic** copy — використовуй `text-ui-body` / `text-ui-system` / `text-ui-label`.
- Hardcode `Merriweather` або інші шрифти поза `themes.ts` / `index.html`.

## Дозволені винятки (не мігрувати без окремого epic)

| Виняток | Приклад | Причина |
|---------|---------|---------|
| **Logo** | `text-7xl` in `Shared.tsx` | Frozen game title |
| **Game display** | `packages/client/src/screens/GameFlow/**` | Display scale, clamp, milestones |
| **Icon glyph size** | Material Symbols `text-[18px]`, pause icon `text-[80px]` | Icon font metrics, not text roles |
| **Emoji avatar sizing** | `text-sm` on `<span>{p.avatar}</span>` in `TeamCard`, `UnassignedPool` | Emoji glyph scale in avatar circle, not semantic copy |
| **Admin monospace** | `font-mono text-xs` in `admin/tabs/*` | Compact admin panel (optional Phase 8) |
| **CSS clamp()** | word card responsive sizes | Fluid game typography |

## Перевірка перед PR

```bash
# App UI (exclude GameFlow) — має бути 0
rg "text-\[[0-9]+px\]" packages/client/src --glob "*.tsx" --glob "!**/GameFlow/**"

pnpm typecheck
pnpm --filter @movli/client test
```

## `font-serif` у TSX

= **heading role**, не «завжди Playfair». Runtime family з theme через `.font-serif` in `styles.css` (`--font-heading`).
